203	   * Pre-formatted "Last backup: <date>" line for the mobile auto-backups section
204	   * (#7901), or undefined when no local backup has run yet. Reflects the time as
205	   * of opening Settings — good enough for a "you're protected" indicator without
206	   * wiring a live subscription. Uses toLocaleString() to match the Electron
207	   * restore prompt's date formatting.
